    s: ['Dependable delivery: you complete filings and workpapers accurately — valuable in busy season.', 'Kindness under pressure: you help colleagues without complaint.', 'A steady mind: you keep calm when deadlines stack up.'],
    g: ['Your work goes unseen: keep a weekly summary of what you completed.', 'You take on too much: use a board to see workload and ask for balance.'],
    t: [T('ChatGPT', 'main', 'A tax Q&A assistant', 'Turn your firm’s common questions into a custom tax Q&A so you answer less repeat mail.', 'Draft answers to the ten questions clients most often ask about estimated tax payments.'),
        T('Monday.com', 'specialist', 'See the workload', 'Track returns and deadlines on one board so work is visible and balanced.', 'Set up a board that shows each return’s status, owner and due date.'),
        T('Notion AI', 'specialist', 'Process wiki', 'Write your procedures once in a wiki, so the team can find them without asking you.', 'Turn this checklist into a wiki page with steps and common mistakes.')],
    syn: 'Quiet reliability plus AI becomes visible value: ChatGPT answers, Monday tracks, Notion documents. Your work gets seen and your load gets lighter.',
