    s: ['Approachable finance: business teams bring you questions early — valuable in business partnering.', 'Warm explanations: you make numbers easy to discuss.', 'Relationship energy: you build trust across departments.'],
    g: ['Details slip: capture decisions and next steps right after each talk.', 'Too many requests: set office hours.'],
    t: [T('ChatGPT', 'main', 'Explain it simply', 'Turn variance tables into plain-language talking points for business partners.', 'Turn this budget variance table into five plain-language talking points for the sales team.'),
        T('Loom', 'specialist', 'Explain once, share many times', 'Record short walk-throughs of reports so people can watch instead of asking again.', 'Outline a 4-minute video explaining how to read the monthly variance report.'),
        T('Otter.ai', 'specialist', 'Keep the decisions', 'Record and summarize meetings (with consent) so decisions and next steps are not lost.', 'List decisions and next steps from this meeting transcript by owner.')],
